<!--
  IHateWeblogic – Font test report (smoke test)

  Purpose: one boilerplate text per font family the customers use most, each
  with its own <font face>, text with umlauts (fields of a generated default
  layout ignore <font> - all came out in the default font, 2026-10-23). The PDF shows which TrueType file the
  Reports engine embeds for each family (uifont.ali [PDF:Subset] /
  [PDF:Embed], REPORTS_FONT_DIRECTORY) - checked by 15- with pdffonts and
  04-ReportsFonts/pdf_font_verify.sh.

  Expected on the test host (uifont.ali of this repository):
    Arial, Helvetica   -> LiberationSans      Times New Roman -> LiberationSerif
    Courier New        -> LiberationMono      Tahoma          -> DejaVuSans
    Liberation Sans    -> LiberationSans      DejaVu Sans     -> DejaVuSans
  A font that falls back to Courier / Symbol or is not embedded = mapping
  missing (04-ReportsFonts/README.md section 11).

  Deployed/converted by: 09-Install/15-deploy-test-report-forms_template.sh
-->
